--- Section 13: source for network users ---

If you run a modified version of this software as a network service, the
AGPL requires you to offer its users the source of your modified version.
The gateway serves this at GET /source, which points at the repository the
running instance was built from. Keep that endpoint accurate if you fork.

--- Third-party components ---

This repository vendors no third-party source. Dependencies are declared in
gateway/requirements.txt and fetched at install time under their own
licences.
